# Privacy Policy for InovXA

Last updated: April 2026

InovXA ("we", "our", or "us") operates the InovXA mobile application (the "App"). This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information when you use our App.

---

## 1. Information We Collect

InovXA is designed to work offline and does not collect or store personal data on external servers.

However, the App may store the following information locally on your device:

- Business name, address, phone number, email, and ABN (if provided)
- Invoice details entered by you (client name, items, pricing, etc.)
- Logo images selected from your device

This data is stored only on your device and is not transmitted to us.

---

## 2. How We Use Information

All information entered into the App is used solely to:

- Generate invoices in PDF format  
- Display and pre-fill your business details for convenience  
- Enable sharing of invoices via apps like email or messaging platforms  

We do not use your data for analytics, tracking, or advertising.

---

## 3. Data Storage and Security

- All data is stored locally on your device using secure system storage.
- We do not have access to your data.
- If you uninstall the App, your stored data may be permanently deleted.

---

## 4. Permissions

The App may request the following permissions:

### Storage / Files
Used to save generated PDF invoices to your device (e.g., Downloads folder).

### Photos / Media
Used to allow you to select a logo image for your invoices.

These permissions are used only for core app functionality.

---

## 5. Third-Party Services

InovXA does not use third-party services for:

- Analytics  
- Advertising  
- Cloud storage  

All functionality is handled locally on your device.

---

## 6. Data Sharing

We do not collect, sell, rent, or share your personal data with any third parties.

Any sharing of invoices is done manually by you using your device’s sharing features.

---

## 7. Children’s Privacy

InovXA does not knowingly collect personal information from children. Since all data is stored locally and not transmitted, we do not have access to any user data.

---

## 8. Changes to This Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected in the updated version within the App or on our official page.

---

## 9. Contact Us

If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact us at:

Email: support@inovxa.com (you can change this to your real email)

---

## 10. Consent

By using the App, you agree to this Privacy Policy.
